   "text": "Bitcoin was roughly flat at about $61,200 on Monday Nov 23, 2026 while the Nasdaq Composite rose 6.51% and the S&P 500 rose 4.74%, leaving crypto out of Wall Street's rally; Ethereum was near $1,719 and Solana rose about 2.8% to $72.57.",
