  },
  {
   "text": "US spot Bitcoin ETFs recorded approximately $1.8 billion of net outflows in the week before Nov 23, 2026, and Bitcoin was down about 5.9% over the prior seven days.",
   "source": "The Motley Fool",
   "url": "https://www.fool.com/coverage/stock-market-today/2026/11/23/crypto-market-today-nov-23-bitcoin-sits-out-wall-street-s-historic-rally-as-usd1-8-billion-etf-exodus-weighs-on-prices/"
  },
  {
   "text": "Bitcoin ETF share prices bounced on Monday Nov 23, 2026, with BlackRock's IBIT up 4.85% and Fidelity's FBTC up about 5.1%, after the prior week's decline took Bitcoin to a two-year low near $55,000.",
   "source": "The Motley Fool",
   "url": "https://www.fool.com/coverage/stock-market-today/2026/11/23/crypto-market-today-nov-23-bitcoin-sits-out-wall-street-s-historic-rally-as-usd1-8-billion-etf-exodus-weighs-on-prices/"
  },
  {
   "text": "October core PCE inflation and the second estimate of Q3 GDP are both due Wednesday Nov 25, 2026, with the Cleveland Fed nowcast projecting +0.3% month-over-month core and a y/y rate near 3.2%; initial jobless claims also move to Wednesday.",
